e $x$-intercepts of the paraboloid, we substitute $y=0$ and $z=0$ in the equation of the paraboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(x-5)^{2}-3(0-1)^{2} & =0+5 \\\\ 2(x-5)^{2}-3 & =5 \\\\ 2(x-5)^{2} & =8 \\\\ (x-5)^{2} & =4 \\\\ x-5 & =\\pm 2 \\\\ x & =5\\pm 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives the solutions $x=3$ and $x=7.$\n\nTherefore, the intercepts with the $x$-axis are $(3,0,0)$ and $(7,0,0).$" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316264 13194139534870 true] [17592186316263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316265 13194139534870 true] [17592186316263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316266 13194139534870 true] [17592186316263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316267 13194139534870 true] [17592186316263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316268 13194139534870 true] [17592186316263 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534870 true] [17592186316263 1041 "selection" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316263 1104 #edb/ref 17592186316268 13194139534870 true] [17592186316263 1110 #uuid "84643361-8a4b-582d-b7c7-1dea547080ab" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316264 1034 "$(5,0,0)$ only" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316264 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534870 true] [17592186316264 1111 #uuid "2852dd76-2277-5d7f-bade-b7881d93f419" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316265 1034 "$(-3,0,0)$ and $(2,0,0)$" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316265 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534870 true] [17592186316265 1111 #uuid "8c656b83-ff58-556b-838c-e4e99a3a2b5c" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316266 1034 "$(7,0,0)$ only" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316266 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534870 true] [17592186316266 1111 #uuid "8e7906f1-f524-5662-b765-11ca37a93260" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316267 1034 "$(-2,0,0)$ and $(2,0,0)$" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316267 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534870 true] [17592186316267 1111 #uuid "b0f30924-78d4-5a15-9151-ca04b9f52dc7" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316268 1034 "$(3,0,0)$ and $(7,0,0)$" 13194139534870 true] [17592186316268 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 1